{"id":"H3359","lemma":"יְקַמְיָה","transliteration":"yeqamyah","sayIt":"ye-qam-YAH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jekamiah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.2.41;\nson of: Shallum (H7967I);\nfather of: Elishama (H0476J)\n§ Jecamiah or Jekamiah = \"Jehovah raises\"\n1) a descendant of Judah, son of Shallum in the line of Ahlai\n2) a descendant of David and one of the seven introduced into the royal line on the failure of it in the person of Jehoiachin","glosses":["jekamiah"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jekamiah","kjv":"Jekamiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jekamiah","kjv":"Jecamiah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:41","note":"and Shallum became the father of Jekamiah, and Jekamiah became the father of Elishama.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H7597","lemma":"שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵל","transliteration":"shealtiel","gloss":"Shealtiel"},{"id":"H0476","lemma":"אֱלִישָׁמָע","transliteration":"elishama","gloss":"Elishama"},{"id":"H1953","lemma":"יְהוֹשָׁמָע","transliteration":"hoshama","gloss":"Hoshama"},{"id":"H7967","lemma":"שַׁלּוּם","transliteration":"shallum","gloss":"Shallum"},{"id":"H4443","lemma":"מַלְכִּירָם","transliteration":"malkiram","gloss":"Malchiram"},{"id":"H6305","lemma":"פְּדָיָהוּ","transliteration":"pedayah","gloss":"Pedaiah"},{"id":"H8137","lemma":"שֶׁנְאַצַּ֑ר","transliteration":"shenatstsar","gloss":"Shenazzar"},{"id":"H5072","lemma":"נְדַבְיָה","transliteration":"nedavyah","gloss":"Nedabiah"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3359H","gloss":"Jekamiah","relation":"H3359H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}